  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAEL Biomass Energy Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proceeds of the ADB debt financing will be utilized to fund the construction of five biomass power plants with total generation capacity of 74.5-megawatt, utilizing agricultural residue as feedstock, in districts of Bikaner, Churu, Hanumangarh, Jhunjhunu and Sikar in Rajasthan state, India.</narrative>
  </description>
